# Docs before summary

When the requested work is done and this session can edit files, run this check once before the final summary. Skip it when the session cannot edit files.

```bash
python3 .cursor/skills/improve-repo-docs/scripts/diff_hash.py --json
```

Compare `diff_hash` with `.cursor/docs-ledger.json`. When `clean` is true, or the hashes match, write the summary.

When they differ, launch one generalPurpose subagent. Do not edit documentation in the parent turn. Tell the subagent to read `.cursor/skills/improve-repo-docs/SKILL.md` and run it in working-tree mode. It writes the ledger last.

The stop hook repeats this check if the ledger hash was not updated.
